        {
          "id": 2027694325,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "The WSDG says they are the same but the build jobs are using different versions so I split them out. Not sure if/when they will diverge by design in the future.  \n\nhttps://www.wireshark.org/docs/wsdg_html/#ChSetupUNIXBuildEnvironmentSetup\n\n> at the time of this writing the Qt 6.5.3 “macOS” component is used to build the official packages.\n\nhttps://www.wireshark.org/docs/wsdg_html/#ChSetupQt\n\n> We recommend the latest LTS version, and the stable Windows installers currently ship with Qt 6.5.3. \n\nhttps://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/jobs/7488985895\n\n\u001b[32;1m$ $env:CMAKE_PREFIX_PATH = \"C:\\qt\\6.5.3\\msvc2019_64\"\u001b[0;m\n * Qt6CoreTools (required version >= 6.5.3)\n\nhttps://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/jobs/7488935255\n\u001b[34m==>\u001b[0m \u001b[1mDownloading https://ghcr.io/v2/homebrew/core/qt/manifests/6.7.0_1\u001b[0m\n* Qt6CoreTools (required version >= 6.7.0)",
          "author": {
            "id": 6701257,
            "username": "chuckcraft",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Chuck Craft",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
