        {
          "id": 2081342847,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "> A warning instead of a fatal error would be reasonable, yes.  \n  \n> My take was that the intention of this ...  \n\nSee original comments above about \"me\" = \"lazy\" and an out of date build system.",
          "author": {
